{"id": "lg_display-2026-11-13-005", "date": "2026-11-13", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 46, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": ["lg_display", "lg_elec", "samsung_elec"], "customers": ["lg_elec", "samsung_elec"], "suppliers": ["lg_display"]}, "topics": ["panel_price", "oled_penetration", "it_panel_demand"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.9, "reasons": ["多公司提及", "供應鏈上下游同時提及"]}, "title": "Sigmaintell: Samsung Display and LG Display to raise OLED monitor panel prices in 2027, as memory costs surge", "content": "<p>According to market research firm Sigmaintell, both <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/samsung-oled\">Samsung Display</a> and <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/lg-oled\">LG Display</a> plan to raise the prices of their OLED monitor panels in 2027. Rising material costs - mostly driven by surging memory chip prices - have also led both companies to lower their 2027 OLED monitor panel shipment targets, as higher prices are expected to dampen demand.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/sigmaintell-samsung-display-and-lg-display-raise-oled-monitor-panel-prices-2027", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "lg_elec-2026-11-13-006", "date": "2026-11-13", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 46, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": ["lg_elec", "tcl", "csot"], "customers": ["tcl"], "suppliers": ["csot"]}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.9, "reasons": ["多公司提及", "供應鏈上下游同時提及"]}, "title": "TCL CSOT reveals its inkjet printed OLED material supply chain, as LG Electronics considers printed OLED monitors for 2028-2029", "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/csot-oled\">TCL CSOT</a> revealed the material suppliers for its inkjet printed OLED panels at its annual DTC 2026 (Display Technology Conference) event, held on November 13 in Wuhan. The company listed five companies that supply it with OLED inks and materials:</p><ul><li data-list-item-id=\"ed5e4d3330f4a8a616d3c3d7238963cf0\"><a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sun-fine-chem\">SFC</a> - blue emissive layer (EML) ink</li><li data-list-item-id=\"eeb31097804f5bf3f9", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/tcl-csot-reveals-its-inkjet-printed-oled-material-supply-chain-lg-electronics", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-11-13-007", "date": "2026-11-13", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 46, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration", "earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 1.0, "keywords": ["record"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.9, "reasons": ["涉及財報", "情緒極端"]}, "title": "Solus Advanced Materials reports record quarterly OLED material sales in Q3 2026, up 26% from Q2", "content": "<p>Korea-based OLED materials maker <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/doosan-solus\">Solus Advanced Materials</a> reported its preliminary financial results for Q3 2026, and its OLED business had its best quarter ever, with revenues of $25.4 million, up 26% from Q2 2026 and 5.6% from Q3 2025.</p><a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/mcp-uploads/Solus-Q3-2026-OLED-sales.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"align-center align-center\" src=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/solus-advanced-materials-reports-record-quarterly-oled-material-sales-q3-2026", "type": "rss"}]}
